Puṣpaka rises heavenward at Rāma command --- Rāma shows Sītā Laṅkā and bloody battlefield --- Rāma names slain chiefs and mourning Mandōdarī with widows --- Rāma shows ocean tīrtha Nala bridge and Maināka hill --- Rāma shows Vibhīṣaṇa arrival Kiṣkindhā R̥śyamūka and Sugrīva pact --- Rāma shows Pampā Śabarī Kabandha and Jaṭāyu clash --- Rāma names Janasthāna Khara slaying and seized hut site --- Rāma shows Gōdāvarī Agastya Śarabhaṅga Atri Virādha Citrakūṭa shrines --- Rāma shows Yamunā Bharadvāja Gaṅgā Guha and Ayōdhyā for homage --- Vānaras leap to behold gleaming Ayōdhyā